{"ts":"2026-08-30T08:50:46.580Z","type":"quest-declared","sealed":{"doneWhen":{"probe":"test-receipt","args":{"file":"solve/evidence/joiner-waiting-liveness-log.receipt.json","requiredReceipts":["still-waiting-line-on-liveness-cadence","no-line-once-gate-satisfied","evidence-advance-debug-rate-limited","no-evidence-advance-without-change","ready-instant-unchanged","budgets-and-cadence-unchanged","witness-deterministic"]}},"frontierMetrics":[{"probe":"test-receipt","args":{"file":"solve/evidence/joiner-waiting-liveness-log.receipt.json","requiredReceipts":["still-waiting-line-on-liveness-cadence","no-line-once-gate-satisfied","evidence-advance-debug-rate-limited","no-evidence-advance-without-change","ready-instant-unchanged","budgets-and-cadence-unchanged","witness-deterministic"]}}],"authoringContractVersion":1,"statement":"A joiner that is honestly waiting inside the operation-ledger formation barrier tells the operator so on the live log: the joining owner (NodeJoiningOperationLedgerFormationReadiness) emits a typed still-waiting line (JOINING_LOG_MSG.PRIORITY_PLACEMENT_FORMATION_BARRIER_STILL_WAITING) on every EXISTING liveness-refresh tick while the barrier is engaged, naming the owner's own barrier state and startup-authority answer plus elapsed ms since the wait began, and a typed evidence-advance line at debug level rate-limited to one per liveness-refresh window when the gate's evidence changed but the gate is still unsatisfied. The lines are a projection of the owner's existing barrier snapshot: no new timer, sleep, or polling acceleration, no second readiness authority, nothing re-derived from nodes.status, publication counts, or coverage, JOINING_DEFAULT cadences and the 60-second GCP certification window byte-identical, and the READY instant proven identical with and without the lines. Proven deterministically through the real awaitOperationLedgerFormationBarrier on a virtual clock (30-second honest wait): red on HEAD (no line during the wait), green after.","title":null,"class":"product","constraints":[{"id":"source-change-subagent-verification","statement":"If this Quest changes source code, spawn a subagent verifier before audit and git handoff, then record a Solver finding with evidence subagent:<id>."},{"id":"single-joining-owner","statement":"The joining owner (NodeJoiningOperationLedgerFormationReadiness) remains the single emitter; the lines are a projection of its existing barrier snapshot and introduce no second readiness authority."},{"id":"no-re-derivation","statement":"The wait reason is the owner's own barrier state and the readiness owner's startup-authority answer it already holds; nothing is re-derived from nodes.status, publication counts, or coverage."},{"id":"existing-cadence-only","statement":"The still-waiting line rides only the existing liveness-refresh tick and the evidence-advance line only the existing poll; no timer, sleep, or polling acceleration is added."},{"id":"unchanged-budgets","statement":"JOINING_DEFAULT discovery/poll/timeout/heartbeat and the 60-second GCP certification window are byte-identical, and the READY instant is identical with and without the lines."},{"id":"deterministic-first","statement":"Proof is a virtual-clock witness through the real owner, red on HEAD (2/7 receipts red) and green after (7/7), with green controls that must stay green; no GCP run is part of the proof."}],"verificationTemplates":[],"landingRequirements":null,"frontierIds":["joiner-waiting-liveness-log-main"]}}
